## 4. AI Runtime Engine & Model

### Ollama
- **Usage**: Local inference server accessed exclusively via loopback `http://127.0.0.1:11434`. Used as the AI advisory execution engine in `src/inspector/ai/worker.py` when enabled.
- **Licence**: MIT (see https://github.com/ollama/ollama/blob/main/LICENSE).

### Qwen3-4B (`qwen3:4b`)
- **Usage**: Machine learning language model executed via local Ollama for advisory release purpose classification.
- **Repository Boundary**: Model weights are **never** stored, tracked, or committed in this repository. Weights are managed externally on the host machine by Ollama.
- **Model Digest**: `359d7dd4bcdab3d86b87d73ac27966f4dbb9f5efdfcc75d34a8764a09474fae7`
- **Licence**: Apache-2.0 (see https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-4B).
